cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this version of BHSM Blackhole Tracker together with the exact reviewed BHSM Git commit and artifact hashes used. The software citation is distinct from the historical repository DOI and from empirical identification of a black hole."
type: software
title: "BHSM Blackhole Tracker"
authors:
